4,1,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want this trip to be a big adventure! But I also want to know exactly how much it costs from the start. I'll look into ""All-in rates against meals bought separately"" and ""Pricing of offshore houses let whole.""","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm not in the mood for a logistical nightmare this year. I'll check ""Ferry sailings and train time"" and ""Getting around by train and bus"" to see which option actually lets us relax.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that we need a clear financial structure this time. I will look into ""What separately booked rooms cost last time"" and ""All-in rates against meals bought separately"" to compare the payment methods.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I want to make sure we actually have a place to relax and that the schedule isn't too strict. I'll look into ""Bathing hours and bathroom provision"" and ""Inn mealtimes and room arrangements.""","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I want to understand the balance between our group time and our personal space. I will look into ""Time alone in the shared-house year"" and ""How last year's days ran.""","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Does anyone else have ideas for what we should check? I hope the island houses aren't too expensive, because I really want to go there!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, enthusiasm is fine, but let's not forget that ""adventure"" often translates to ""wasting hours in transit."" I'm more interested in the efficiency of the route than the destination itself.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, efficiency is important, but so is fairness. If we don't understand how the costs are split, the trip won't be relaxing for everyone. I'm focusing on the billing side to avoid any confusion.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I just want to make sure we aren't all crammed into one room with a strict schedule. If we have to wake up at the same time and eat together every single meal, it's not a vacation.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I think we are all looking at different pieces of the same puzzle. While you focus on the logistics and the costs, I want to ensure the environment we choose doesn't alienate any of us.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm just excited! @Toshio, that sounds very deep. I just hope we can all be happy and that I don't run out of money halfway through! Let's see what we find out!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, your wallet is your own responsibility, but I'll be the one keeping us on schedule. Let's just hope the data we gather actually leads to a rational decision for once.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, rationality requires a fair system, not just a fast train. I'll be interested to see if the data supports a more structured way of handling the expenses this year.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not trying to be difficult, but if the place is uncomfortable, no amount of ""rationality"" or ""fairness"" will make it a good trip. I'm sticking to my choices.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,It seems we have covered the main concerns. I will wait for the results to see how the physical and social layout of our options affects the group dynamic.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready! I can't wait to see if the island is an option. Let's all share what we find out in the next round so we can pick the best place!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, we don't ""share"" the data; we analyze it. I'll be waiting to see if the travel times are actually reasonable or if we're just signing up for another marathon of waiting.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I'll be analyzing the cost structures. If we can find a way to make the payments transparent and equal from the start, it will prevent any resentment later. I'm ready to see the results.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready too. I just hope the places we're looking at actually have decent bathrooms and some space to breathe. Let's see if we can find a spot that doesn't feel like a boot camp.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I am also ready. We have each looked into different aspects of the trip; now we can see how these factors intersect to determine the best environment for us.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
